        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Milo Parker, Callan McAuliffe, Ben Kingsley, Gillian Anderson, Anke Engelke, Bastian Pastewka\n- Products: Robot Overlords, Ghost Hunters on Icy Trails, Mr. Holmes, Miss Peregrine's Home for Peculiar Children\n- Roles: Connor, Roger Munro, Hugh Apiston, Hugo\n- Topics: British child actors, film casts, film titles\n\nFacts:\n- Milo Parker, born in 2002, is a British child actor.\n- Milo Parker is known for playing Connor in \"Robot Overlords,\" Roger Munro in \"Mr. Holmes,\" and Hugh Apiston in \"Miss Peregrine's Home for Peculiar Children.\"\n- \"Robot Overlords,\" originally titled \"Our Robot Overlords,\" is a 2014 British independent science fiction film.\n- \"Robot Overlords\" stars Callan McAuliffe, Ben Kingsley, and Gillian Anderson.\n- \"Ghost Hunters on Icy Trails\" is a 2015 German-Austrian-Irish comedy film.\n- \"Ghost Hunters on Icy Trails\" stars Anke Engelke, Milo Parker, and Bastian Pastewka as the voice of Hugo.",
